    chairsPages: "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1rem 0; padding: 10px 14px; background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em;\"><strong>SEAMUN I 2027 — no pages:</strong> This conference does not recruit committee pages. Delegates pass notes digitally through <strong>InterMUN</strong>; there is no paper note-passing or page staff.</p>\n<p>Chairs are expected to be diplomatic, professional, impartial, engaging, calm, creative, empathetic, passionate, decisive, welcoming, punctual, encouraging, and accountable — with additional expectations for ESL and crisis committees (realistic crises, no celebrities).</p>\n<p><strong>Chair report:</strong> High-quality study guide required. Download the <a href=\"../assets/seamun-i-2027-chair-report-template.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">official chair report template (PDF)</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Chair decisions (SEAMUN I 2027 only):</strong> The chair decisions mechanism applies only to this conference—not other MUNs on SEAMUNs. <a href=\"../assets/seamun-i-2027-chair-decisions.pdf\" download=\"SEAMUN-I-2027-Chair-Decisions.pdf\">Download PDF</a> · <a href=\"../assets/seamun-i-2027-chair-decisions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open in new tab</a> · <a href=\"chair-guide.html#chair-decisions\">View on Chair Guide</a></p>\n<div class=\"template-pdf-preview-wrap template-pdf-preview-wrap--compact\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><iframe class=\"template-pdf-preview-frame\" title=\"SEAMUN I 2027 Chair Decisions preview\" src=\"../assets/seamun-i-2027-chair-decisions.pdf#view=FitH\"></iframe></div>\n<p><strong>Applications:</strong> Chair applications for SEAMUN I 2027 are closed.</p>",
